<!--
  Status-bar small icon for the reminders channel.

  Status-bar small icons MUST be a silhouette on a transparent background: any
  non-transparent pixel is treated as part of the silhouette and re-tinted by the
  system, so a drawable with a solid backdrop fills the bar with a white square.
  The launcher icon (ic_still_cal_launcher) has a #000000 backdrop for the
  rounded-square app surface — fine for the launcher, wrong for the status bar.

  Path follows the Material "Today" glyph (Apache 2.0, Android Open Source Project) —
  a calendar grid with one day marked, the convention for event/reminder notifications.
-->
